{"id": "C-S182hyHAS", "title": "Video by gauravecomm", "description": "Another Massive Win of One of Our E-commerce Agency Clients\n\nOne thing that is hard to find in this industry is genuine care for the client, consistent success, & scale that matters — that’s our only mission here.\n\nA satisfied and happy customer is the best business strategy for a successful business🚀\n\nThis Is what I do every day for my clients no matter whether you are an e-commerce agency owner or an ecommerce brand owner... I can help you out just like I did for this SMMA client🤑 \n\n🚀 It’s time to get the engine running on your store for Q3 and Q4 especially – with BFCM, the biggest sales event of the entire year. \n\nScaling is Just a Fun🚀When your core foundation is Strong💪\n\n🚀 If you’ve been following our amazing e-com community for a while, you know success comes from year-round consistency and building the foundations and systems that keep your business running.\n\nSuccess loves MOMENTUM, so get up, get at it, get uncomfortable, & make a MOVE today. \n\nYour Ecom Guy\n\nGaurav Ecom🤠\n\n#shopify #facebookads #ecommerce #clientswin", "channel": "gauravecomm", "uploader_id": "48548887345", "uploader": "Gaurav Kapoor Ecom & Lead Gen Expert", "timestamp": 1722874216, "like_count": 2, "comment_count": 2, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-884492280158490a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 83.307, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fskt4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQOWmg4fZ6qUH2vij5oouLvSpVp8drLN8nnhMUDOjZKlVljyohAesCwiXFxwyfYumCUw3-QlvaeL8KPscTKWjV4.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdrUpdhW8IJQPnmpZo8X63PD-NwtM0BaJyztHrU2FYm_ft5mMJs-JGUHkZ4vbAJWNWw&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fskt4-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=oJcLqgKzinsQ7kNvwGlabNM&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=9x9is5M1lj5XF3QrQwitOw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQIX4HtZjSgpplomk